      "message": "Merge upstream/main (ed24aead) into issue/716-mcp-move-model\n\nOne conflict, in crates/app/src/commands/move_model.rs: main's MoveModel\nnow keeps its following stock as StockMove { name, before, after, reshape }\nand adds moved_stock() and write_stock() (#561 locate). Kept both sides:\nmain's code as is, and this PR's following_stock() accessor now reads\nStockMove::name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
